# Mystery Gift by gift code (docs/decisions.md "Mystery Gift with gift codes"), the Member Card. Mystery Gift is the
# title's screen; replays open the same model over the field (`open mystery-gift`) and enter a test-only code
# (`giftcodes test`; the real codes are not in the repo). RECEIVE GIFT, the code on the naming keyboard (lower case:
# codes are case-insensitive), "Searching…", the card and "Receive this gift?", YES, "Receiving…", received: the Wonder
# Card and the deliveryman's gift in the save. A wrong code: "There were no gifts to be found." The same code again:
# "You've already received this gift." Then into Sandgem's Poké Mart: its on-transition (MysteryGiftDeliveryman
# OnMartTransition) shows the deliveryman; he hands over the Member Card (the key item and VAR_DISTRIBUTION_EVENT_DARKRAI's
# magic number, decomp InitDarkraiEvent) with the ROM's own messages, then has no more gifts.
giftcodes test
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_TURTWIG 10 platinum:MOVE_TACKLE
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_SANDGEM_TOWN 187 843 up
until idle
+0 open mystery-gift
until app mystery-gift
+1 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_Welcome 0
+1 tap menu:0
until app naming
+1 tap type:testdark
+1 tap ok
until app mystery-gift
+1 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_SearchingForGift 0
+65 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_ReceiveThisGift 0
+0 assert state mysteryGift.received []
+1 tap yes
+1 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_ReceivingGiftDontTurnOff 0
+95 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_GiftReceivedPickUpInPokeMart 0
+0 assert state mysteryGift.received ["darkrai"]
+0 assert state mysteryGift.cards[0] {"gift":"darkrai","received":"2009-03-22"}
+0 assert state mysteryGift.deliveries[0] {"gift":"darkrai","card":0}
+1 tap next
+1 tap next
until app none
# A wrong code.
+1 open mystery-gift
until app mystery-gift
+1 tap menu:0
until app naming
+1 tap type:QQQQQQQQ
+1 tap ok
until app mystery-gift
+65 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_NoGiftsToBeFound 0
+1 tap next
+1 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_Welcome 0
# The same code again.
+1 tap menu:0
until app naming
+1 tap type:TESTDARK
+1 tap ok
until app mystery-gift
+65 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_AlreadyReceivedCantGetAnotherOne 0
+1 tap next
+1 assert state mysteryGift.cards[1] null
+1 tap menu:2
until app none
+0 reload
until idle
# Into the Poké Mart: the deliveryman is there.
+0 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_SANDGEM_TOWN_MART" 300
+0 release up
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_MART_MYSTERY_GIFT_DELIVERYMAN false
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_AVAILABLE_MYSTERY_GIFT_EXISTS 1
+0 press up
until position 3 8 300
+0 release up
+0 press right
until position 4 8 300
+0 release right
+0 press up
until state player.facing "up" 30
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
until message
+0 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftDeliveryman_Text_MiddayGreeting 0
+0 press a
+1 release a
until message
+0 press a
+1 release a
until message
+0 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftDeliveryman_Text_ReceivedMemberCard 0
advance text
until idle
+0 assert state bag.key_items[item="platinum:ITEM_MEMBER_CARD"].count 1
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_DISTRIBUTION_EVENT_DARKRAI 4617
+0 assert state mysteryGift.deliveries[0] null
+0 assert state mysteryGift.cards[0].gift "darkrai"
# No more gifts.
+0 press a
+1 release a
until message
+0 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftDeliveryman_Text_NoMoreGifts 0
advance text
until idle
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state bag.key_items[item="platinum:ITEM_MEMBER_CARD"].count 1
